OL,3,GNEWSADonation extension in #30m bid for
OL,4,Aestate
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deadline for donations to
OL,7,Fconservation groups aiming to raise
OL,8,F#30m to buy a vast upland estate has
OL,9,Fbeen extended.
OL,11,FThe Wildlife Trusts and Northumberland
OL,12,FWildlife Trust said they were close to
OL,13,Fraising the full amount to acquire the
OL,14,FRothbury Estate in its entirety and
OL,15,Fwould take out a loan for anything they
OL,16,Ffell short by.
OL,18,FPete Batchelor, from the Northumberland
OL,19,FTrust, said: "The more funds raised
OL,20,Fthrough our fundraising appeal, the
OL,21,Fsmaller the loan will be."
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
