OL,3,GNEWSADonation extension in #30m bid for
OL,4,Aestate
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, the window for public
OL,7,Fdonations to the fund, backed by major
OL,8,Ffigures including Sir David
OL,9,FAttenborough, had been due to close on
OL,10,F30 September but has been extended
OL,11,Funtil the end of October.
